WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:11.870
Drafts are replies the assistant wrote that are waiting for you. In Manual approval mode every reply comes here; in Auto-reply mode, only the ones it is unsure about.

2
00:00:12.419 --> 00:00:18.680
Read the suggested reply; the customer's message, and when the reply was written, are beside it.

3
00:00:19.232 --> 00:00:26.700
If it is right, approve and send it. If not, edit the text and then send, or reject it.

4
00:00:27.246 --> 00:00:32.460
Switch between Auto-reply and Manual approval with the buttons at the top of the page.
